// Three equal bars, 5:3. The symbol is the Commons drawing's, whose 800 by 480 view box is the whole flag.
vexyl 1
meta {
  name "Twink flag"
  encoder "Naomi Persephone Amethyst"
  license "CC0-1.0"
  adapted-from "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Twink_Pride_Flag_(proposed).svg" {
    author "Keymap9, vectorizing kaisuteknon's image, with the male symbol from the Symbola font"
    license "CC0-1.0"
    part "the double male symbol"
  }
  date "2009-06-05"
  source "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Twinkprideflag.jpg"
  source "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/archive/4/4d/20140817182431%21Twinkprideflag.jpg"
  source "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4d/Twinkprideflag.jpg"
  source "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Twink_Pride_Flag_(proposed).svg"
  source "https://lgbtqia.fandom.com/wiki/Twink"
  note "The earliest copy found is an image the English Wikipedia user kaisuteknon uploaded on 5 June 2009 as 'A twink pride flag', saying 'I created this work entirely by myself'. It was moved to Commons in 2014 with its upload log. No other source names a designer or an earlier publication, so whether kaisuteknon designed the flag, or only drew the image, isn't known, and no designer is given."
  note "kaisuteknon uploaded two versions that day, both 794 by 476 pixels. The first, at 13:13, has a red double male symbol at the top left of the pink stripe. The second, at 13:21, 'Better design, cleaned up', has a black symbol at the center. This file is the second, the one in use."
  note "The colors are read from the images' pixels, the same in both: #ffb0ff pink, #ffffff white and #ffff80 yellow. The three stripes are equal thirds, 160, 160 and 156 pixels, and the image's 794:476, 1.668, is 5:3 within 0.1%."
  note "The double male symbol is two interlocked male signs, which is artwork rather than a geometric figure. It is the Commons drawing's, used unchanged. That drawing (Keymap9, 9 April 2018, CC0) reproduces kaisuteknon's second image, taking the male sign from the Symbola font, and its stripes and colors match the image."
}
palette {
  pink "#ffb0ff"
  white "#ffffff"
  yellow "#ffff80"
}
proportion hoist=3 fly=5

bars pink white yellow

charge svg {
  at center
  fly 5
  hoist 3
  markup #"""
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 800 480"><path d="M417.3 214.1H410V189l-20.5 20.5c5.9 7.1 8.8 15.3 8.8 24.6 0 10.7-3.8 19.8-11.2 27.3-7.5 7.5-16.6 11.3-27.3 11.3s-19.8-3.8-27.3-11.2c-7.5-7.5-11.2-16.6-11.2-27.3s3.7-19.8 11.2-27.3c7.5-7.5 16.6-11.2 27.3-11.2 9.3 0 17.5 2.9 24.6 8.8l20.4-20.4h-25v-7.4h33.8l3.8 3.8v33.6zm-26.4 20.1c0-8.7-3-16-9.1-22.1-6.1-6.1-13.4-9.1-22.1-9.1s-16 3-22.1 9.1c-6.1 6.1-9.1 13.4-9.1 22.1s3 16 9.1 22.1c6.1 6.1 13.4 9.1 22.1 9.1s16-3 22.1-9.1c6.1-6.1 9.1-13.5 9.1-22.1z"/><path d="M457.3 244.1H450V219l-20.5 20.5c5.9 7.1 8.8 15.3 8.8 24.6 0 10.7-3.8 19.8-11.2 27.3-7.5 7.5-16.6 11.3-27.3 11.3s-19.8-3.8-27.3-11.2c-7.5-7.5-11.2-16.6-11.2-27.3s3.7-19.8 11.2-27.3c7.5-7.5 16.6-11.2 27.3-11.2 9.3 0 17.5 2.9 24.6 8.8l20.4-20.4h-25v-7.4h33.8l3.8 3.8v33.6zm-26.4 20.1c0-8.7-3-16-9.1-22.1-6.1-6.1-13.4-9.1-22.1-9.1s-16 3-22.1 9.1c-6.1 6.1-9.1 13.4-9.1 22.1s3 16 9.1 22.1c6.1 6.1 13.4 9.1 22.1 9.1s16-3 22.1-9.1c6.1-6.1 9.1-13.5 9.1-22.1z"/></svg>
    """#
}
